# INVCALL.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C), run by
# TEST/WIN/winnb.sh as "/NET NOSUCH", a name no station has: the status
# bar names the server, the call fails with INV's reason and the
# NetBIOS return code, and ENTER on the message box ends the program.
# Every mode of Windows writes TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVCALL.SNP.
S NOCALL
K ENTER
S GONE
